Package: alien-predator
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, acpi-call-dkms
Recommends: libgl1, libxkbcommon0
Description: Hardware control for Acer Predator and Nitro laptops
 Fan control, keyboard lighting, turbo flags and telemetry on Acer gaming
 laptops, with no vendor software and no Windows.
 .
 A clean-room implementation of the gaming WMI protocol, verified against real
 firmware. Where a control is accepted by the firmware but has no observable
 effect on a given model, this software says so rather than implying it works.
 .
 Ships a CLI (alien), a terminal UI (alien-tui), a desktop app (alien-gui) and
 the privileged helper (alien-daemon) that owns the firmware interface so the
 frontends can stay unprivileged.
